{
  "id": "wr83rgmXM9YUEPzROgSO",
  "title": "Dataset: Origin City Archives",
  "subtitle": "Release of the first dataset for Openvoxels, a DAO whose mission seeks to preserve, curate, augment, and promote historical digital artifacts from the metaverse",
  "imageUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/bf9844c6157a8e592d7180d943c053b552d60da128104b0045644f1871da3e99.jpg",
  "slug": "dataset-origin-city-archives",
  "staticHtml": "<p>Release of the first dataset for Openvoxels, a DAO whose mission seeks to preserve, curate, augment, and promote historical digital artifacts from the metaverse beginning with the virtual world of Cryptovoxels.</p><hr><p>New here? Read Part 1:</p><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" class=\"dont-break-out\" href=\"https://mirror.xyz/openvoxels.eth/hBQzBNwFXrOnwj5S5oOiYaBpQrpM8HfjENYMjKcy6Cs\">https://mirror.xyz/openvoxels.eth/hBQzBNwFXrOnwj5S5oOiYaBpQrpM8HfjENYMjKcy6Cs</a></p><hr><h2 id=\"h-parcels-3d-datasets\" class=\"text-3xl font-header !mt-8 !mb-4 first:!mt-0 first:!mb-0\">Parcels 3D Datasets</h2><ul><li><p>⭐ <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" class=\"dont-break-out\" href=\"https://skfb.ly/oyOxO\"><strong>https://skfb.ly/oyOxO</strong></a> - Cryptovoxels districts 12-13-19 snapshot</p></li></ul><div data-type=\"embedly\" src=\"https://skfb.ly/oyOxO\" data=\"{&quot;provider_url&quot;:&quot;https://sketchfab.com&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;openvoxels 2019 - A 3D model collection by m3org&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;openvoxels 2019 - A 3D model collection by m3org&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_width&quot;:1024,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://sketchfab.com/m3org/collections/openvoxels-2019-20fbe88b085a44cb8f9fad26fc6297aa&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_url&quot;:&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/36daae6e2d374fe746ca3a2f77dd4f084b266f002a726f3dc8e9eef47873160c.jpg&quot;,&quot;version&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;provider_name&quot;:&quot;Sketchfab&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_height&quot;:576,&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;base64&quot;:&quot;data:image/png;base64,&quot;,&quot;img&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:1024,&quot;height&quot;:576,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/36daae6e2d374fe746ca3a2f77dd4f084b266f002a726f3dc8e9eef47873160c.jpg&quot;}}}\" format=\"small\"><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/36daae6e2d374fe746ca3a2f77dd4f084b266f002a726f3dc8e9eef47873160c.jpg\"><div class=\"react-component embed my-5\" data-drag-handle=\"true\" data-node-view-wrapper=\"\" style=\"white-space:normal\"><a class=\"link-embed-link\" href=\"https://skfb.ly/oyOxO\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><div class=\"link-embed\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><div><h2>openvoxels 2019 - A 3D model collection by m3org</h2><p>openvoxels 2019 - A 3D model collection by m3org</p></div><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link h-3 w-3 my-auto inline mr-1\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg>https://sketchfab.com</span></div><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/36daae6e2d374fe746ca3a2f77dd4f084b266f002a726f3dc8e9eef47873160c.jpg\"></div></a></div></div><ul><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" class=\"dont-break-out\" href=\"https://viewblock.io/arweave/address/f7QsdAM6sBC0UsUp1JoEXT93yMbCAPQIo1uBLhjDGSE\">Arweave backups</a> - JSON data backups since 2021 stored on Arweave</p></li><li><p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" class=\"dont-break-out\" href=\"https://gist.github.com/samcamwilliams/26e0505d11a7c25cafc95e08c5be9c13\">CryptoVoxelsArchive.sh</a> - Script used to take daily data snapshots</p></li></ul><p>Sketchfab is the leading 3D model sharing website on the web that many <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" class=\"dont-break-out\" href=\"https://sketchfab.com/members?segment=organization%2Fmuseum&amp;sort_by=-followerCount&amp;cursor=cD02MTI%3D\">cultural institutions and museums</a> have picked to showcase artifacts on. They offer a wide range of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" class=\"dont-break-out\" href=\"https://sketchfab.com/importers\">plugins</a> to import models directly into your favorite 3D software easily.</p><figure float=\"none\" data-type=\"figure\" class=\"img-center\" style=\"max-width: null;\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/24ac7f64f63eb385331ae32f1c38ed6558b60acb4c59c895ccf20408d53ad233.gif\" alt=\"Importing districts from a Sketchfab importer: https://sketchfab.com/importers\" blurdataurl=\"data:image/png;base64,\" nextheight=\"338\" nextwidth=\"600\" class=\"image-node embed\"><figcaption htmlattributes=\"[object Object]\" class=\"\">Importing districts from a Sketchfab importer: https://sketchfab.com/importers</figcaption></figure><p>With the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" class=\"dont-break-out\" href=\"https://github.com/sketchfab/blender-plugin/releases/latest\">blender plugin</a> you can search for <code>cryptovoxels 2019</code> and quickly import chunks from the 12-13-2019 dataset into your project.</p><figure float=\"none\" data-type=\"figure\" class=\"img-center\" style=\"max-width: null;\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/f49016077aaf353ea11548f732631c5ec7d8571f110c5906c50ff83e55425e5c.png\" alt=\"You can import as much or as little as you want. I labeled the dataset with the year it was taken as a tag for optimizing search.\" blurdataurl=\"data:image/png;base64,\" nextheight=\"1049\" nextwidth=\"1920\" class=\"image-node embed\"><figcaption htmlattributes=\"[object Object]\" class=\"\">You can import as much or as little as you want. I labeled the dataset with the year it was taken as a tag for optimizing search.</figcaption></figure><p>We are planning to take another 3D snapshot of the world on the 3rd anniversary of the last one, <strong>12-13-2022</strong>, and run a buildathon alongside. Join the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" class=\"dont-break-out\" href=\"https://discord.gg/m3org\">M3 discord</a> if you want to help us plan..</p><hr><h2 id=\"h-optimization\" class=\"text-3xl font-header !mt-8 !mb-4 first:!mt-0 first:!mb-0\">Optimization</h2><p>The biggest district in the collection is Frankfurt comes in at a whopping 150mb and 1.7M triangles. I took a double look when I was able to compress this model down to 3.3mb via Draco using <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" class=\"dont-break-out\" href=\"http://gltf.report\">http://gltf.report</a>. I could still could shave 30% with gzip as well, making the final compressed version only 2.1mb. To compare with a different method, Meshopt compression only went to 25mb and broke the collision in Hyperfy.</p><figure float=\"none\" data-type=\"figure\" class=\"img-center\" style=\"max-width: null;\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/5f8b5a75257cdc8708a47014c77746389d60b1eccadbd57ceac307d27bde81d8.jpg\" alt=\"Comparing uncompressed to Draco and meshopt file size for Frankfurt district, the biggest district in Origin City\" blurdataurl=\"data:image/png;base64,\" nextheight=\"1026\" nextwidth=\"1863\" class=\"image-node embed\"><figcaption htmlattributes=\"[object Object]\" class=\"\">Comparing uncompressed to Draco and meshopt file size for Frankfurt district, the biggest district in Origin City</figcaption></figure><p>The only complaint I heard about Draco is that the size of the WASM library decoder may outweigh size savings for geometry &lt;1MB. If that's all then no biggie - the size difference between uncompressed and other forms of compression like meshopt is substantial in our case.</p><figure float=\"none\" data-type=\"figure\" class=\"img-center\" style=\"max-width: null;\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/3e3a641c1f62886b3a19334f0c47ec11bab7291c9da83c8f9c390bd55f4ca159.jpg\" alt=\"Comparing compressed file size for the entire Origin City dataset, Draco is 32.1 MB compared to 1.43 GB uncompressed\" blurdataurl=\"data:image/png;base64,\" nextheight=\"1027\" nextwidth=\"1854\" class=\"image-node embed\"><figcaption htmlattributes=\"[object Object]\" class=\"\">Comparing compressed file size for the entire Origin City dataset, Draco is 32.1 MB compared to 1.43 GB uncompressed</figcaption></figure><h2 id=\"h-use-cases\" class=\"text-3xl font-header !mt-8 !mb-4 first:!mt-0 first:!mb-0\">Use Cases</h2><ul><li><p>Digital preservation</p><ul><li><p>glTF 2.0 is an international standard file format for 3D models</p></li><li><p>Snapshot virtual worlds like the Internet Archive Wayback machine</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Create living museums</p><ul><li><p>Recreate CV as it were during a period in time</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Alternate realities</p><ul><li><p>See how Voxels might look with diff skyboxes or weather</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Sandbox for rapid prototyping</p><ul><li><p>Experiment and use to pitch features</p></li><li><p>Good ideas can make their way back to main</p></li></ul></li><li><p>Home space decoration (scale to tabletop size)</p></li><li><p>Mixed media art projects / 3D rendering</p></li></ul><h2 id=\"h-final-thoughts\" class=\"text-3xl font-header !mt-8 !mb-4 first:!mt-0 first:!mb-0\">Final Thoughts</h2><p>I want to close this with various ideas that have inspired me during this part.</p><div data-type=\"youtube\" videoid=\"K8I28erYFLc\">\n      <div class=\"youtube-player\" data-id=\"K8I28erYFLc\" style=\"background-image: url('https://i.ytimg.com/vi/K8I28erYFLc/hqdefault.jpg'); background-size: cover; background-position: center\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K8I28erYFLc\">\n          <img src=\"https://paragraph.com/editor/youtube/play.png\" class=\"play\">\n        </a>\n      </div></div><p>More about the Internet Archive: <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc\" class=\"dont-break-out\" href=\"https://github.com/madjin/internet-archive-vr#media\">https://github.com/madjin/internet-archive-vr#media</a></p><figure float=\"none\" data-type=\"figure\" class=\"img-center\" style=\"max-width: null;\"><img src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/040b7b5bd583a456010f8f1e8fe8047762c813618c2e4d8d0e1456155b58afe0.png\" alt=\"Source: https://fvm.filecoin.io/\" blurdataurl=\"data:image/png;base64,\" nextheight=\"842\" nextwidth=\"1269\" class=\"image-node embed\"><figcaption htmlattributes=\"[object Object]\" class=\"\">Source: https://fvm.filecoin.io/</figcaption></figure><div data-type=\"twitter\" tweetid=\"1350620913583214594\"> \n  <div class=\"twitter-embed embed\">\n    <div class=\"twitter-header\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex\">\n          <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/dankvr\">\n              <img alt=\"User Avatar\" class=\"twitter-avatar\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/e0ca7aab77b353b4c451dd7c3f44777894e4e50c6d6e42ae157c7ec83ab788a8.jpg\">\n            </a>\n            <div style=\"margin-left:4px;margin-right:auto;line-height:1.2;\">\n              <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/dankvr\" class=\"twitter-displayname\">jin</a>\n              <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/dankvr\" class=\"twitter-username\">@dankvr</a></p>\n    \n            </div>\n            <a href=\"https://twitter.com/dankvr/status/1350620913583214594\" target=\"_blank\">\n              <img alt=\"Twitter Logo\" class=\"twitter-logo\" src=\"https://paragraph.com/editor/twitter/logo.png\">\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    <div class=\"twitter-body\">\n      Places like Helsinki have 3D data of their entire city available in multiple formats as *open data* devs are free to download and build from.<br><br>It's been used for data viz, virtual tours, VR festivals, and minecraft. Would love to see more places try this.<br><br><a class=\"twitter-content-link\" href=\"https://t.co/kOULTrPz2g\" target=\"_blank\">hel.fi/helsinki/en/ad…</a> \n      <div class=\"twitter-media\"><div class=\"twitter-four-images\"><img class=\"twitter-image\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/510576acd0ff46b93098d3cbf5efc25fe6292092d9e57881b258bd463cc476a5.jpg\"></div></div>\n      \n       \n    </div>\n    \n     <div class=\"twitter-footer\">\n          <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/dankvr/status/1350620913583214594\" style=\"margin-right:16px; display:flex;\">\n            <img alt=\"Like Icon\" class=\"twitter-heart\" src=\"https://paragraph.com/editor/twitter/heart.png\">\n            30\n          </a>\n          <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/dankvr/status/1350620913583214594\"><p>8:48 PM • Jan 16, 2021</p></a>\n        </div>\n    \n  </div> \n  </div><h3 id=\"h-desci\" class=\"text-2xl font-header !mt-6 !mb-4 first:!mt-0 first:!mb-0\">DeSci</h3><div data-type=\"embedly\" src=\"https://future.com/what-is-decentralized-science-aka-desci/\" data=\"{&quot;provider_url&quot;:&quot;https://a16zcrypto.com&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;What to know about the new DeSci movement&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;A Guide to DeSci, the Latest Web3 Movement - a16z crypto&quot;,&quot;author_name&quot;:&quot;Sarah Hamburg&quot;,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://a16zcrypto.com/posts/article/what-is-decentralized-science-aka-desci/&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_width&quot;:1200,&quot;version&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;provider_name&quot;:&quot;a16z crypto&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_height&quot;:628}\" format=\"small\"><div class=\"react-component embed my-5\" data-drag-handle=\"true\" data-node-view-wrapper=\"\" style=\"white-space:normal\"><a class=\"link-embed-link\" href=\"https://future.com/what-is-decentralized-science-aka-desci/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><div class=\"link-embed\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><div><h2>A Guide to DeSci, the Latest Web3 Movement - a16z crypto</h2><p>What to know about the new DeSci movement</p></div><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-link h-3 w-3 my-auto inline mr-1\"><path d=\"M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71\"></path><path d=\"M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71\"></path></svg>https://a16zcrypto.com</span></div></div></a></div></div><div data-type=\"twitter\" tweetid=\"1541047522088472578\"> \n  <div class=\"twitter-embed embed\">\n    <div class=\"twitter-header\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex\">\n          <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/0xidanlevin\">\n              <img alt=\"User Avatar\" class=\"twitter-avatar\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/c1243bcb2231aabadfeaf539268497ab7b977c7f902bc835283fe38b1a7790c2.jpg\">\n            </a>\n            <div style=\"margin-left:4px;margin-right:auto;line-height:1.2;\">\n              <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/0xidanlevin\" class=\"twitter-displayname\">idan levin</a>\n              <p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/0xidanlevin\" class=\"twitter-username\">@0xidanlevin</a></p>\n    \n            </div>\n            <a href=\"https://twitter.com/0xidanlevin/status/1541047522088472578\" target=\"_blank\">\n              <img alt=\"Twitter Logo\" class=\"twitter-logo\" src=\"https://paragraph.com/editor/twitter/logo.png\">\n            </a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      \n    <div class=\"twitter-body\">\n      Why is DeSci the next big thing <img class=\"twitter-emoji\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"🧵\" src=\"https://abs-0.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f9f5.png\">\n      \n      \n       \n    </div>\n    \n     <div class=\"twitter-footer\">\n          <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/0xidanlevin/status/1541047522088472578\" style=\"margin-right:16px; display:flex;\">\n            <img alt=\"Like Icon\" class=\"twitter-heart\" src=\"https://paragraph.com/editor/twitter/heart.png\">\n            293\n          </a>\n          <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://twitter.com/0xidanlevin/status/1541047522088472578\"><p>9:15 AM • Jun 26, 2022</p></a>\n        </div>\n    \n  </div> \n  </div><hr><h2 id=\"h-participate-open-tasks\" class=\"text-3xl font-header !mt-8 !mb-4 first:!mt-0 first:!mb-0\">Participate: Open Tasks</h2><p>Make some cool art using the Openvoxels dataset and earn some tokens 💰</p><div data-type=\"embedly\" src=\"https://app.dework.xyz/m3/openvoxels/view/open-tasks-l6rgqctg?taskId=53425dc9-b405-4dae-8e69-4bf429638481\" data=\"{&quot;provider_url&quot;:&quot;https://app.dework.xyz&quot;,&quot;description&quot;:&quot;Read more about this task from M3 on Dework!&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Create 3D rendered art from Origin City dataset | Dework&quot;,&quot;mean_alpha&quot;:74.9179487179,&quot;thumbnail_width&quot;:2048,&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://app.dework.xyz/m3/openvoxels/view/open-tasks-l6rgqctg?taskId=53425dc9-b405-4dae-8e69-4bf429638481&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_url&quot;:&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/cc4a07b883aa0b8fe44740b5b1b8e6028268b779feea85a7707bc7f41a1a4c67.png&quot;,&quot;version&quot;:&quot;1.0&quot;,&quot;provider_name&quot;:&quot;Dework&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;link&quot;,&quot;thumbnail_height&quot;:1170,&quot;image&quot;:{&quot;base64&quot;:&quot;data:image/png;base64,&quot;,&quot;img&quot;:{&quot;width&quot;:2048,&quot;height&quot;:1170,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/cc4a07b883aa0b8fe44740b5b1b8e6028268b779feea85a7707bc7f41a1a4c67.png&quot;}}}\" format=\"small\"><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/papyrus_images/cc4a07b883aa0b8fe44740b5b1b8e6028268b779feea85a7707bc7f41a1a4c67.png\"><div class=\"react-component embed my-5\" data-drag-handle=\"true\" data-node-view-wrapper=\"\" style=\"white-space:normal\"><a class=\"link-embed-link\" href=